@startuml seq-structure-alert
title Structure alert -> closest character -> Set destination (0.7)
autonumber
actor "Player" as user
participant "Browser\n(alerts.js)" as ui
participant "Web app\n(app.py)" as web
participant "AlertService" as alerts
participant "zKillboard R2Z2" as zkb
participant "ESI" as esi
participant "Discord" as discord
database "SQLite" as db

== background, every poll_s (>= 6 s) ==
alerts -> zkb : GET {sequence}.json (User-Agent)
zkb --> alerts : killmail package (or 404 = caught up)
alerts -> esi : /universe/types, /universe/groups (cached in type_groups)
alerts -> alerts : victim is a structure? -> destroyed (+ core drop)\nkill within grid_km of a known structure? -> combat\nstructure among attackers? -> firing
alerts -> db : INSERT OR IGNORE structure_alerts
opt Discord enabled
  alerts -> discord : embed + link /alerts#alert-<id>
end

== the player looks ==
ui -> web : GET /api/alerts (every 30 s)
web -> db : recent alerts, the main's characters + snapshots
web -> web : one BFS per alert system -> 3 closest characters
web --> ui : groups by structure, closest characters, can_set_route
ui -> user : card + desktop notification / sound for new alerts

== Set destination ==
user -> ui : "Set destination" (online character)
ui -> web : POST /api/characters/{id}/destination {destination_id}
web -> esi : POST /ui/autopilot/waypoint (character token,\nclear_other_waypoints=true)
esi --> web : 204 (404 when offline -> 502 "is the character online?")
web --> ui : destination set to <system>
@enduml
